  "details": "i noticed yesterday that every single avatar i have my self and even public models and even tested this with a few friends every single one had similar issues not as grave as mine. but all of them has an issue with the Index controllers. mainly the Index finger is having some odd issues where it intersects with the middle finger quite often. can be seen in the picture. and to make it worse whenever you bend the finger it sorta steps further towards the middle finger.",
